ALCHEMY_STARS_CARD_ALCHEMY_STARS_FOREST_:
Deal {Damage:diff()} {ForestTitle} damage to an enemy.
While Flying, also apply {WeakPower:diff()} Weak.{IfUpgraded:show:
Spend {forestLightPrefix:lightIcons(1)}: Gain 1 Flying first.|}

Discard up to 2 cards. Deal {ForestTitle} damage twice equal to the total Energy cost of discarded cards.
If a Curse or Status is discarded, Exhaust it and deal {Damage:diff()} {ForestTitle} damage for each.{IfUpgraded:show:
Draw 1 card.|}

Gain {AlchemyStarsFlyingPower:diff()} Flying, record your current hand size, and gain 1 Receipt Mail.
If you already had Flying: At the start of next turn, gain 2 Energy and {forestLightPrefix:lightIcons(1)}.{IfUpgraded:show:
Gain an upgraded Receipt Mail.|}

Remove all debuffs on yourself, add 3 Spirit cards to your Draw pile, and draw {Cards:diff()} cards.
If you already had Flying, this card costs 1 less.{IfUpgraded:show:
Add upgraded Spirit cards.|}

Add 3 Origin cards to your hand.
Each time this card is Retained, reduce its cost by 1.{IfUpgraded:show:
Add upgraded Origin cards.|}

When Retained, deal {Damage:diff()} {ForestTitle} damage to a random enemy, increase this card's damage by {Increase:diff()} this combat, then add a copy to your Discard pile.
On play, Exhaust and deal random damage.{IfUpgraded:show:
The copy added to your Discard pile is upgraded.|}

